  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Type:</strong> Cyberleg<br><strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 3 (1d6)<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 2</p>\n<p>Cyberleg Option. Requires two Cyberlegs, takes 2 Option Slots, and must be paired. +2 to Stealth checks about moving quietly. If the user has spent no more than half their MOVE, rounding up, and hasn't Run on the Turn of the check, it's +4 instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>The effect gives +2 and is situational; add the other +2 in the roll dialog when the movement condition is met.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberlegs).</em></p>"
